,"key":"79:13","arabic":"فَإِنَّمَا هِىَ زَجْرَةٌ وَٰحِدَةٌ","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, it will be but one shout,","id":"Maka pengembalian itu hanyalah dengan sekali tiupan saja.","latinEn":"Fa-innama hiya zajratun wahida","latinId":"Fa innamā hiya zajratuw wāḥidah(tun).","words":[{"a":"فَإِنَّمَا","en":"Then only","id":"Then only","t":"fa-innamā"},{"a":"هِىَ","en":"it","id":"it","t":"hiya"},{"a":"زَجْرَةٌۭ","en":"(will be) a shout","id":"(will be) a shout","t":"zajratun"},{"a":"وَٰحِدَةٌۭ","en":"single","id":"single","t":"wāḥidatun"}]},{"n":14,"key":"79:14","arabic":"فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface.","id":"Maka seketika itu mereka hidup kembali di bumi (yang baru).","latinEn":"Fa-itha hum bissahira","latinId":"Fa iżā hum bis-sāhirah(ti).","words":[{"a":"فَإِذَا","en":"And behold","id":"And behold","t":"fa-idhā"},{"a":"هُم","en":"They","id":"They","t":"hum"},{"a":"بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ","en":"(will be) awakened","id":"(will be) awakened","t":"bil-sāhirati"}]},{"n":15,"key":"79:15","arabic":"هَلْ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"Has there reached you the story of Moses? -","id":"Sudahkah sampai kepadamu (Muhammad) kisah Musa?","latinEn":"Hal ataka hadeethu moosa","latinId":"Hal atāka ḥadīṡu mūsā.","words":[{"a":"هَلْ","en":"Has","id":"Has","t":"hal"},{"a":"أَتَىٰكَ","en":"(there) come to you","id":"(there) come to you","t":"atāka"},{"a":"حَدِيثُ","en":"(the) story","id":"(the) story","t":"ḥadīthu"},{"a":"مُوسَىٰٓ","en":"(of) Musa","id":"(of) Musa","t":"mūsā"}]},{"n":16,"key":"79:16","arabic":"إِذْ نَادَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلْوَادِ ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Ṭuwā,","id":"Ketika Tuhan memanggilnya (Musa) di lembah suci yaitu Lembah Tuwa;","latinEn":"Ith nadahu rabbuhu bilwadialmuqaddasi tuwa","latinId":"Iż nādāhu rabbuhū bil-wādil-muqaddasi ṭuwā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِذْ","en":"When","id":"When","t":"idh"},{"a":"نَادَىٰهُ","en":"called him","id":"called him","t":"nādāhu"},{"a":"رَبُّهُۥ","en":"his Lord","id":"his Lord","t":"rabbuhu"},{"a":"بِٱلْوَادِ","en":"in the valley","id":"in the valley","t":"bil-wādi"},{"a":"ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ","en":"the sacred","id":"the sacred","t":"l-muqadasi"},{"a":"طُوًى","en":"(of) Tuwa","id":"(of) Tuwa","t":"ṭuwan"}]},{"n":17,"key":"79:17","arabic":"ٱذْهَبْ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"\"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed.","id":"pergilah engkau kepada Fir'aun! Sesungguhnya dia telah melampaui batas,","latinEn":"Ithhab ila firAAawna innahu tagha","latinId":"Iżhab ilā fir‘auna innahū ṭagā.","words":[{"a":"ٱذْهَبْ","en":"Go","id":"Go","t":"idh'hab"},{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"to","id":"to","t":"ilā"},{"a":"فِرْعَوْنَ","en":"Firaun","id":"Firaun","t":"fir'ʿawna"},{"a":"إِنَّهُۥ","en":"Indeed, he","id":"Indeed, he","t":"innahu"},{"a":"طَغَىٰ","en":"(has) transgressed","id":"(has) transgressed","t":"ṭaghā"}]},{"n":18,"key":"79:18","arabic":"فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself","id":"Maka katakanlah (kepada Fir'aun), \"Adakah keinginanmu untuk membersihkan diri (dari kesesatan),","latinEn":"Faqul hal laka ila an tazakka","latinId":"Fa qul hal laka ilā an tazakkā.","words":[{"a":"فَقُلْ","en":"And say","id":"And say","t":"faqul"},{"a":"هَل","en":"Would","id":"Would","t":"hal"},{"a":"لَّكَ","en":"[for] you","id":"[for] you","t":"laka"},{"a":"إِلَىٰٓ","en":"[to]","id":"[to]","t":"ilā"},{"a":"أَن","en":"[that]","id":"[that]","t":"an"},{"a":"تَزَكَّىٰ","en":"purify yourself","id":"purify yourself","t":"tazakkā"}]},{"n":19,"key":"79:19","arabic":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]?'\"","id":"dan engkau akan kubimbing ke jalan Tuhanmu agar engkau takut kepada-Nya?\"","latinEn":"Waahdiyaka ila rabbika fatakhsha","latinId":"Wa ahdiyaka ilā rabbika fa takhsyā.","words":[{"a":"وَأَهْدِيَكَ","en":"And I will guide you","id":"And I will guide you","t":"wa-ahdiyaka"},{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"to","id":"to","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"فَتَخْشَىٰ","en":"so you would fear","id":"so you would fear","t":"fatakhshā"}]},{"n":20,"key":"79:20","arabic":"فَأَرَىٰهُ ٱلْـَٔايَةَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And he showed him the greatest sign,","id":"Lalu (Musa) memperlihatkan kepadanya mukjizat yang besar.","latinEn":"Faarahu al-ayata alkubra","latinId":"Fa arāhul-āyatal-kubrā.","words":[{"a":"فَأَرَىٰهُ","en":"Then he showed him","id":"Then he showed him","t":"fa-arāhu"},{"a":"ٱلْـَٔايَةَ","en":"the sign","id":"the sign","t":"l-āyata"},{"a":"ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","en":"the great","id":"the great","t":"l-kub'rā"}]},{"n":21,"key":"79:21","arabic":"فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"But he [i.e., Pharaoh] denied and disobeyed.","id":"Tetapi dia (Fir'aun) mendustakan dan mendurhakai.","latinEn":"Fakaththaba waAAasa","latinId":"Fa każżaba wa ‘aṣā.","words":[{"a":"فَكَذَّبَ","en":"But he denied","id":"But he denied","t":"fakadhaba"},{"a":"وَعَصَىٰ","en":"and disobeyed","id":"and disobeyed","t":"waʿaṣā"}]},{"n":22,"key":"79:22","arabic":"ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"Then he turned his back, striving [i.e., plotting].","id":"Kemudian dia berpaling seraya berusaha menantang (Musa).","latinEn":"Thumma adbara yasAAa","latinId":"Ṡumma adbara yas‘ā.","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"أَدْبَرَ","en":"he turned his back","id":"he turned his back","t":"adbara"},{"a":"يَسْعَىٰ","en":"striving","id":"striving","t":"yasʿā"}]},{"n":23,"key":"79:23","arabic":"فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And he gathered [his people] and called out.","id":"Kemudian dia mengumpulkan (pembesar-pembesarnya) lalu berseru (memanggil kaumnya).","latinEn":"Fahashara fanada","latinId":"Fa ḥasyara fanādā.","words":[{"a":"فَحَشَرَ","en":"And he gathered","id":"And he gathered","t":"faḥashara"},{"a":"فَنَادَىٰ","en":"and called out","id":"and called out","t":"fanādā"}]},{"n":24,"key":"79:24","arabic":"فَقَالَ أَنَا۠ رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord.\"","id":"(Seraya) berkata, \"Akulah tuhanmu yang paling tinggi.\"","latinEn":"Faqala ana rabbukumu al-aAAla","latinId":"Fa qāla ana rabbukumul-a‘lā.","words":[{"a":"فَقَالَ","en":"Then he said","id":"Then he said","t":"faqāla"},{"a":"أَنَا۠","en":"I am","id":"I am","t":"anā"},{"a":"رَبُّكُمُ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbukumu"},{"a":"ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ","en":"the Most High","id":"the Most High","t":"l-aʿlā"}]},{"n":25,"key":"79:25","arabic":"فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"So Allāh seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]..","id":"Maka Allah menghukumnya dengan azab di akhirat dan siksaan di dunia.","latinEn":"Faakhathahu Allahu nakalaal-akhirati wal-oola","latinId":"Fa akhażahullāhu nakālal-ākhirati wal-ūlā.","words":[{"a":"فَأَخَذَهُ","en":"So seized him","id":"So seized him","t":"fa-akhadhahu"},{"a":"ٱللَّهُ","en":"Allah","id":"Allah","t":"l-lahu"},{"a":"نَكَالَ","en":"(with) an exemplary punishment","id":"(with) an exemplary punishment","t":"nakāla"},{"a":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en":"(for) the last","id":"(for) the last","t":"l-ākhirati"},{"a":"وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ","en":"and the first","id":"and the first","t":"wal-ūlā"}]},{"n":26,"key":"79:26","arabic":"إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةً لِّمَن يَخْشَىٰٓ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed in that is a lesson [i.e., warning] for whoever would fear [Allāh].","id":"Sungguh, pada yang demikian itu terdapat pelajaran bagi orang yang takut (kepada Allah).","latinEn":"Inna fee thalika laAAibratan limanyakhsha","latinId":"Inna fī żālika la‘ibratal limay yakhsyā.","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"فِى","en":"in","id":"in","t":"fī"},{"a":"ذَٰلِكَ","en":"that","id":"that","t":"dhālika"},{"a":"لَعِبْرَةًۭ","en":"surely (is) a lesson","id":"surely (is) a lesson","t":"laʿib'ratan"},{"a":"لِّمَن","en":"for whoever","id":"for whoever","t":"liman"},{"a":"يَخْشَىٰٓ","en":"fears","id":"fears","t":"yakhshā"}]},{"n":27,"key":"79:27","arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ ۚ بَنَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? He [i.e., Allāh] constructed it.","id":"Apakah penciptaan kamu yang lebih hebat ataukah langit yang telah dibangun-Nya?","latinEn":"Aantum ashaddu khalqan ami assamaobanaha","latinId":"A'antum asyaddu khalqan amis-samā'u banāhā.","words":[{"a":"ءَأَنتُمْ","en":"Are you","id":"Are you","t":"a-antum"},{"a":"أَشَدُّ","en":"a more difficult","id":"a more difficult","t":"ashaddu"},{"a":"خَلْقًا","en":"creation","id":"creation","t":"khalqan"},{"a":"أَمِ","en":"or","id":"or","t":"ami"},{"a":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ ۚ","en":"the heaven","id":"the heaven","t":"l-samāu"},{"a":"بَنَىٰهَا","en":"He constructed it","id":"He constructed it","t":"banāhā"}]},{"n":28,"key":"79:28","arabic":"رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it.","id":"Dia telah meninggikan bangunannya lalu menyempurnakannya,","latinEn":"RafaAAa samkaha fasawwaha","latinId":"Rafa‘a samkahā fa sawwāhā.","words":[{"a":"رَفَعَ","en":"He raised","id":"He raised","t":"rafaʿa"},{"a":"سَمْكَهَا","en":"its ceiling","id":"its ceiling","t":"samkahā"},{"a":"فَسَوَّىٰهَا","en":"and proportioned it","id":"and proportioned it","t":"fasawwāhā"}]},{"n":29,"key":"79:29","arabic":"وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُحَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness.","id":"dan Dia menjadikan malamnya (gelap gulita), dan menjadikan siangnya (terang benderang).","latinEn":"Waaghtasha laylaha waakhraja duhaha","latinId":"Wa agṭasya lailahā wa akhraja ḍuḥāhā.","words":[{"a":"وَأَغْطَشَ","en":"And He darkened","id":"And He darkened","t":"wa-aghṭasha"},{"a":"لَيْلَهَا","en":"its night","id":"its night","t":"laylahā"},{"a":"وَأَخْرَجَ","en":"and brought out","id":"and brought out","t":"wa-akhraja"},{"a":"ضُحَىٰهَا","en":"its brightness","id":"its brightness","t":"ḍuḥāhā"}]},{"n":30,"key":"79:30","arabic":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَىٰهَآ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And after that He spread the earth.","id":"Dan setelah itu bumi Dia hamparkan.","latinEn":"Wal-arda baAAda thalikadahaha","latinId":"Wal-arḍa ba‘da żālika daḥāhā.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en":"And the earth","id":"And the earth","t":"wal-arḍa"},{"a":"بَعْدَ","en":"after","id":"after","t":"baʿda"},{"a":"ذَٰلِكَ","en":"that","id":"that","t":"dhālika"},{"a":"دَحَىٰهَآ","en":"He spread it","id":"He spread it","t":"daḥāhā"}]},{"n":31,"key":"79:31","arabic":"أَخْرَجَ مِنْهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرْعَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture,","id":"Darinya Dia pancarkan mata air, dan (ditumbuhkan) tumbuh-tumbuhannya.","latinEn":"Akhraja minha maahawamarAAaha","latinId":"Akhraja minhā mā'ahā wa mar‘āhā.","words":[{"a":"أَخْرَجَ","en":"He brought forth","id":"He brought forth","t":"akhraja"},{"a":"مِنْهَا","en":"from it","id":"from it","t":"min'hā"},{"a":"مَآءَهَا","en":"its water","id":"its water","t":"māahā"},{"a":"وَمَرْعَىٰهَا","en":"and its pasture","id":"and its pasture","t":"wamarʿāhā"}]},{"n":32,"key":"79:32","arabic":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَرْسَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And the mountains He set firmly","id":"Dan gunung-gunung Dia pancangkan dengan kokoh.","latinEn":"Waljibala arsaha","latinId":"Wal-jibāla arsāhā.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ","en":"And the mountains","id":"And the mountains","t":"wal-jibāla"},{"a":"أَرْسَىٰهَا","en":"He made them firm","id":"He made them firm","t":"arsāhā"}]},{"n":33,"key":"79:33","arabic":"مَتَـٰعًا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَـٰمِكُمْ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"As enjoyment [i.e., provision] for you and your grazing livestock.","id":"(Semua itu) untuk kesenanganmu dan untuk hewan-hewan ternakmu.","latinEn":"MataAAan lakum wali-anAAamikum","latinId":"Matā‘al lakum wa li'an‘āmikum.","words":[{"a":"مَتَـٰعًۭا","en":"(As) a provision","id":"(As) a provision","t":"matāʿan"},{"a":"لَّكُمْ","en":"for you","id":"for you","t":"lakum"},{"a":"وَلِأَنْعَـٰمِكُمْ","en":"and for your cattle","id":"and for your cattle","t":"wali-anʿāmikum"}]},{"n":34,"key":"79:34","arabic":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity -","id":"Maka apabila malapetaka besar (hari Kiamat) telah datang,","latinEn":"Fa-itha jaati attammatualkubra","latinId":"Fa iżā jā'atiṭ-ṭāmmatul-kubrā.","words":[{"a":"فَإِذَا","en":"But when","id":"But when","t":"fa-idhā"},{"a":"جَآءَتِ","en":"comes","id":"comes","t":"jāati"},{"a":"ٱلطَّآمَّةُ","en":"the Overwhelming Calamity","id":"the Overwhelming Calamity","t":"l-ṭāmatu"},{"a":"ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ","en":"the great","id":"the great","t":"l-kub'rā"}]},{"n":35,"key":"79:35","arabic":"يَوْمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove,","id":"yaitu pada hari (ketika) manusia teringat akan apa yang telah dikerjakannya,","latinEn":"Yawma yatathakkaru al-insanu masaAAa","latinId":"Yauma yatażakkarul-insānu mā sa‘ā.","words":[{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(The) Day","id":"(The) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"يَتَذَكَّرُ","en":"will remember","id":"will remember","t":"yatadhakkaru"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"man","id":"man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"سَعَىٰ","en":"he strove (for)","id":"he strove (for)","t":"saʿā"}]},{"n":36,"key":"79:36","arabic":"وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلْجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see -","id":"dan neraka diperlihatkan dengan jelas kepada setiap orang yang melihat.","latinEn":"Waburrizati aljaheemu liman yara","latinId":"Wa burrizatil-jaḥīmu limay yarā.","words":[{"a":"وَبُرِّزَتِ","en":"And will be made manifest","id":"And will be made manifest","t":"waburrizati"},{"a":"ٱلْجَحِيمُ","en":"the Hellfire","id":"the Hellfire","t":"l-jaḥīmu"},{"a":"لِمَن","en":"to (him) who","id":"to (him) who","t":"liman"},{"a":"يَرَىٰ","en":"sees","id":"sees","t":"yarā"}]},{"n":37,"key":"79:37","arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"So as for he who transgressed","id":"Maka adapun orang yang melampaui batas,","latinEn":"Faamma man tagha","latinId":"Fa ammā man ṭagā.","words":[{"a":"فَأَمَّا","en":"Then as for","id":"Then as for","t":"fa-ammā"},{"a":"مَن","en":"(him) who","id":"(him) who","t":"man"},{"a":"طَغَىٰ","en":"transgressed","id":"transgressed","t":"ṭaghā"}]},{"n":38,"key":"79:38","arabic":"وَءَاثَرَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"And preferred the life of the world,","id":"dan lebih mengutamakan kehidupan dunia,","latinEn":"Waathara alhayata addunya","latinId":"Wa āṡaral-ḥayātad-dun-yā.","words":[{"a":"وَءَاثَرَ","en":"And preferred","id":"And preferred","t":"waāthara"},{"a":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","en":"the life","id":"the life","t":"l-ḥayata"},{"a":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en":"(of) the world","id":"(of) the world","t":"l-dun'yā"}]},{"n":39,"key":"79:39","arabic":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge.","id":"maka sungguh, nerakalah tempat tinggalnya.","latinEn":"Fa-inna aljaheema hiya alma/wa","latinId":"Fa innal-jaḥīma hiyal-ma'wā.","words":[{"a":"فَإِنَّ","en":"Then indeed","id":"Then indeed","t":"fa-inna"},{"a":"ٱلْجَحِيمَ","en":"the Hellfire","id":"the Hellfire","t":"l-jaḥīma"},{"a":"هِىَ","en":"it","id":"it","t":"hiya"},{"a":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","en":"(is) the refuge","id":"(is) the refuge","t":"l-mawā"}]},{"n":40,"key":"79:40","arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفْسَ عَنِ ٱلْهَوَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination,","id":"Dan adapun orang-orang yang takut kepada kebesaran Tuhannya dan menahan diri dari (keinginan) hawa nafsunya,","latinEn":"Waama man khafa maqamarabbihi wanaha annafsa AAani alhawa","latinId":"Wa ammā man khāfa maqāma rabbihī wa nahan-nafsa ‘anil-hawā.","words":[{"a":"وَأَمَّا","en":"But as for","id":"But as for","t":"wa-ammā"},{"a":"مَنْ","en":"(him) who","id":"(him) who","t":"man"},{"a":"خَافَ","en":"feared","id":"feared","t":"khāfa"},{"a":"مَقَامَ","en":"standing","id":"standing","t":"maqāma"},{"a":"رَبِّهِۦ","en":"(before) his Lord","id":"(before) his Lord","t":"rabbihi"},{"a":"وَنَهَى","en":"and restrained","id":"and restrained","t":"wanahā"},{"a":"ٱلنَّفْسَ","en":"his soul","id":"his soul","t":"l-nafsa"},{"a":"عَنِ","en":"from","id":"from","t":"ʿani"},{"a":"ٱلْهَوَىٰ","en":"the vain desires","id":"the vain desires","t":"l-hawā"}]},{"n":41,"key":"79:41","arabic":"فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَنَّةَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge.","id":"maka sungguh, surgalah tempat tinggal-(nya).","latinEn":"Fa-inna aljannata hiya alma/wa","latinId":"Fa innal-jannata hiyal-ma'wā.","words":[{"a":"فَإِنَّ","en":"Then indeed","id":"Then indeed","t":"fa-inna"},{"a":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ","en":"Paradise","id":"Paradise","t":"l-janata"},{"a":"هِىَ","en":"it (is)","id":"it (is)","t":"hiya"},{"a":"ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ","en":"the refuge","id":"the refuge","t":"l-mawā"}]},{"n":42,"key":"79:42","arabic":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرْسَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"They ask you, [O Muḥammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival?","id":"Mereka (orang-orang kafir) bertanya kepadamu (Muhammad) tentang hari Kiamat, \"Kapankah terjadinya?\"","latinEn":"Yas-aloonaka AAani assaAAatiayyana mursaha","latinId":"Yas'alūnaka ‘anis-sā‘ati ayyāna mursāhā.","words":[{"a":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","en":"They ask you","id":"They ask you","t":"yasalūnaka"},{"a":"عَنِ","en":"about","id":"about","t":"ʿani"},{"a":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","en":"the Hour","id":"the Hour","t":"l-sāʿati"},{"a":"أَيَّانَ","en":"when","id":"when","t":"ayyāna"},{"a":"مُرْسَىٰهَا","en":"(is) its arrival","id":"(is) its arrival","t":"mur'sāhā"}]},{"n":43,"key":"79:43","arabic":"فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَىٰهَآ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it?","id":"Untuk apa engkau perlu menyebutkannya (waktunya)?","latinEn":"Feema anta min thikraha","latinId":"Fīma anta min żikrāhā.","words":[{"a":"فِيمَ","en":"In what","id":"In what","t":"fīma"},{"a":"أَنتَ","en":"(are) you","id":"(are) you","t":"anta"},{"a":"مِن","en":"[of]","id":"[of]","t":"min"},{"a":"ذِكْرَىٰهَآ","en":"(to) mention it","id":"(to) mention it","t":"dhik'rāhā"}]},{"n":44,"key":"79:44","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"To your Lord is its finality.","id":"Kepada Tuhanmulah (dikembalikan) kesudahannya (ketentuan waktunya).","latinEn":"Ila rabbika muntahaha","latinId":"Ilā rabbika muntahāhā.","words":[{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"To","id":"To","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"مُنتَهَىٰهَآ","en":"(is) its finality","id":"(is) its finality","t":"muntahāhā"}]},{"n":45,"key":"79:45","arabic":"إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"You are only a warner for those who fear it.","id":"Engkau (Muhammad) hanyalah pemberi peringatan bagi siapa yang takut kepadanya (hari Kiamat).","latinEn":"Innama anta munthiru manyakhshaha","latinId":"Innamā anta munżiru may yakhsyāhā.","words":[{"a":"إِنَّمَآ","en":"Only","id":"Only","t":"innamā"},{"a":"أَنتَ","en":"you","id":"you","t":"anta"},{"a":"مُنذِرُ","en":"(are) a warner","id":"(are) a warner","t":"mundhiru"},{"a":"مَن","en":"(for him) who","id":"(for him) who","t":"man"},{"a":"يَخْشَىٰهَا","en":"fears it","id":"fears it","t":"yakhshāhā"}]},{"n":46,"key":"79:46","arabic":"كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓا۟ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَىٰهَا","page":584,"juz":30,"en":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof.","id":"Pada hari ketika mereka melihat hari Kiamat itu (karena suasananya hebat), mereka merasa seakan-akan hanya (sebentar saja) tinggal (di dunia) pada waktu sore atau pagi hari.","latinEn":"Kaannahum yawma yarawnaha lamyalbathoo illa AAashiyyatan aw duhaha","latinId":"Ka'annahum yauma yaraunahā lam yalbaṡū illā ‘asyiyyatan au ḍuḥāhā.","words":[{"a":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","en":"As though they","id":"As though they","t":"ka-annahum"},{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(the) Day","id":"(the) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"يَرَوْنَهَا","en":"they see it","id":"they see it","t":"yarawnahā"},{"a":"لَمْ","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lam"},{"a":"يَلْبَثُوٓا۟","en":"they had remained","id":"they had remained","t":"yalbathū"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"عَشِيَّةً","en":"an evening","id":"an evening","t":"ʿashiyyatan"},{"a":"أَوْ","en":"or","id":"or","t":"aw"},{"a":"ضُحَىٰهَا","en":"a morning thereof","id":"a morning thereof","t":"ḍuḥāhā"}]}]}